{"id":"wb-6-75","name":"青墩遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"青墩遗址","text":"青墩遗址是一处位于中国江苏省南通市海安县青墩村的古遗址。于2006年5月成为第六批全国文物保护建筑之一。该遗址于1973年8月开挖青墩新河时为村民所发现，随后经过76年、78年和79年的三次挖掘，出土文物1000余件。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%9D%92%E5%A2%A9%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":86785742,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86785742","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/35fca3677ddf20a79f1bd37f.jpg","title":"青墩遗址.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E9%9D%92%E5%A2%A9%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1d/%E9%9D%92%E5%A2%A9%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Howhowforever","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​青墩遗址","width":320,"height":427}}